(b) Find the constant solutions.
(c) Describe the solution through $(0,0)$ as $x$ increases.
(d) Describe the direction and changing steepness of the solution through $(0,2)$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=9mm,y=9mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
